{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "7b2544b0-d934-8176-9d63-81e26a2813fb",
  "created_at": "2026-03-03T13:06:50-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Kathleen Doyle",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T13:05:13-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T13:05:15-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yes, it's been out three days now, the light in front of my mother's house. I figured somebody would have noticed by now. Oh, wait, is this the water department? I'm sorry, I think I got the wrong office."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T13:05:28-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, you're fine, this is Public Works. We handle streetlights. Which light is it, and where?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T13:05:34-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, good. It's at 364 Narragansett Avenue, in the Fifth Ward. The pole is right at the curb in front of the house. It went dark Saturday night, and it's been dark every night since."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T13:05:46-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. Is the light completely out, or is it flickering or coming on and off?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T13:05:52-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Completely out. No flickering, nothing. It's just dead. I'd like a crew to come check the pole, please."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T13:05:58-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, I'll put in a work order for them to look at it. Is there a number on the pole, a little tag or sticker, by any chance?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T13:06:07-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Let me think. I'm not at the house right now, I'm at my own place. I don't have a number for you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T13:06:15-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's all right, the address will do it. Can I get a callback number in case they need to reach someone?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T13:06:22-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, it's 401-555-0178. That's my landline, and it's me, Kathleen Doyle, calling for my mother."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T13:06:28-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks, Kathleen. I have 364 Narragansett Avenue, streetlight out for three days, pole at the curb out front. It's in the system now. Crews usually get to these within a few days to a week."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T13:06:40-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A few days to a week. Okay. That works. Thank you for taking it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T13:06:45-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Have a good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T13:06:48-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Bye."
    }
  ],
